### Claude Code (personal, local) ###
# Anchored form only matched the repo root; a second .claude exists deeper in the
# tree (src/main/java/com/bot/.claude), so match at any depth.
**/.claude/settings.local.json
**/.claude/worktrees/

### Runtime state, written relative to the process CWD ###
# BotMain writes ./data/calibrator.csv and ./data/forecast_records.csv, RiskGuard
# writes ./data/riskguard.csv. Whichever directory the bot is launched from grows a
# data/ folder — including inside the source tree when launched from an IDE run
# config. State, never source: ignore it wherever it lands.
**/data/

### Offline analysis scratch (data, not code) ###
/analysis/
# Same category as /analysis/: 1.4MB of backtest result CSVs, untracked since it was created.
/archive/
# Local MCP server configuration, per-machine.
/.ai/

### Secrets ###
# local.env carries a Supabase service key. Its own header claimed it was already ignored;
# it was not, and it sat untracked-but-committable from 2026-07-28 until this commit.
# API keys are read from the environment only — see README, "Keys".
local.env
*.env
!example.env